    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BROOKE: Mommie? What's... ...pyri-dox-ine-hydro-chloride?\nCLAIRE: God knows.\nBROOKE: Am I eating it?",
      "CLAIRE: We have rats. I heard them in the walls and then later I heard them in the attic. You wouldn't wake up.\nBROOKE: Are they white ones?",
      "BROOKE: Billy says Pinto's this big.\nCLAIRE: Please, Brooke.",
      "BROOKE: I can't find Rosie.\nCLAIRE: What'd you say, hon?\nBROOKE: Rosie. She's gone.\nCLAIRE: You mean she wasn't in your room when you woke up?",
      "CLAIRE: She was fixed almost a year ago. It doesn't mean she can't go out and --~\nBROOKE: She wouldn't go out for that. I know her. Rosie wouldn't go out for that at all."
    ]
  },
